<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Vista Previa QR — <%= vehicle.patente || vehicle.interno %></title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    body { background: #1a1a2e; }
    .sticker { width: 100mm; height: 70mm; background: #fff; border-radius: 4mm; overflow: hidden; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
    .sticker-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #0ea5e9); padding: 3mm 4mm; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .sticker-body { padding: 3.5mm 4mm; display: flex; gap: 4mm; align-items: center; }
    .sticker-qr { flex-shrink: 0; }
    .sticker-info { flex: 1; color: #1a1a2e; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; }
    .sticker-patente { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: 900; color: #0b0f1a; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1; }
    .sticker-interno { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: 700; color: #1d4ed8; }
    .sticker-detail { font-size: 8pt; color: #333; line-height: 1.4; }
    .sticker-footer { background: #e9ecf3; padding: 2mm 4mm; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 0.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 0 0 4mm 4mm; }
    .sticker-footer span { font-size: 7pt; color: #3f4756; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; }
    * { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important; print-color-adjust: exact !important; color-adjust: exact !important; }
    @media print {
      body { background: #fff !important; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
      .no-print { display: none !important; }
      .sticker { box-shadow: none; margin: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen p-6">
  <div class="no-print max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-8">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Vista Previa — Sticker QR</h1>
        <p class="text-[#8b9bb4] text-sm">Así se verá el adhesivo impreso en el vehículo</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <button onclick="window.print()" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-[#d4af37] hover:bg-[#b8960c] text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-bold transition flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 17h2a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h6a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2zm8-12V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4h10z"/></svg>
          Imprimir Sticker
        </button>
        <a href="/vehicle/<%= vehicle.id %>" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition border border-white/10">
          Volver al vehículo
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-6 mb-6" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); backdrop-filter:blur(12px);">
      <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">URL del QR</h3>
      <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-3 text-sm text-[#8b9bb4] font-mono break-all"><%= qrUrl %></div>
      <p class="text-[#4a5568] text-xs mt-2">Al escanear este código se muestra la página pública con todos los datos del vehículo (sin login)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="no-print flex justify-center mb-6">
    <div class="bg-white/10 rounded-xl px-6 py-3 text-white text-sm">
      <span class="font-semibold">Medidas del sticker:</span> 100mm × 70mm — QR de alto contraste con corrección de errores nivel H (30%)
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex justify-center">
    <div class="sticker" id="sticker">
      <div class="sticker-header">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2mm;">
          <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:2mm;width:8mm;height:8mm;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
            <span style="color:#2563eb;font-size:9pt;font-weight:900;">GF</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;">
            <span style="color:#fff;font-size:10pt;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.5px;">GRUPO FALPAT SRL</span>
            <span style="color:#eaf3ff;font-size:7pt;font-weight:600;">Control de Mantenimiento</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right;">
          <span style="color:#eaf3ff;font-size:7pt;font-weight:700;display:block;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Interno</span>
          <span style="color:#fff;font-size:15pt;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1;"><%= vehicle.interno || '—' %></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sticker-body">
        <div class="sticker-qr">
          <div id="qr-container"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sticker-info">
          <div class="sticker-patente"><%= vehicle.patente || '—' %></div>
          <div style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;color:#0b0f1a;margin-top:2mm;"><%= vehicle.marca || '' %> <%= vehicle.modelo || '' %></div>
          <% if (vehicle.nroBet) { %>
          <div style="margin-top:2mm;">
            <div style="width:13mm;height:13mm;border-radius:50%;border:0.7mm solid #1d4ed8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#eef4ff;">
              <span style="font-size:13pt;font-weight:900;color:#1d4ed8;line-height:1;"><%= vehicle.nroBet %></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sticker-footer">
        <span style="font-size:7pt;color:#222;font-weight:700;"><%= vehicle.marca || '' %> <%= vehicle.modelo || '' %></span>
        <span style="font-size:7pt;color:#3f4756;"><%= vehicle.empresa || '' %></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="no-print max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); backdrop-filter:blur(12px);">
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          Especificaciones técnicas
        </h3>
        <ul class="text-[#8b9bb4] text-sm space-y-2">
          <li>• <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Corrección de errores nivel H</strong> — 30% recuperable si el sticker se daña</li>
          <li>• <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Alto contraste</strong> — Negro puro sobre fondo blanco</li>
          <li>• <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Zona silenciosa</strong> — Borde blanco de 2mm alrededor del QR</li>
          <li>• <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Formato</strong> — 100mm × 70mm (tamaño estándar para stickers vehiculares)</li>
          <li>• <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Resolución recomendada</strong> — 300 DPI para impresión</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-5" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15); backdrop-filter:blur(12px);">
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          Recomendaciones de impresión
        </h3>
        <ul class="text-[#8b9bb4] text-sm space-y-2">
          <li>• Usar <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">papel vinyl o polipropileno</strong> (resistente a lluvia y sol)</li>
          <li>• Impresión en <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">color</strong> para el header de marca</li>
          <li>• Aplicar en superficie <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">lisa y limpia</strong></li>
          <li>• Evitar bordes o esquinas del vehículo (impactos)</li>
          <li>• Posición ideal: <strong class="text-[#ffffff]">puerta lateral o parabrisas</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    new QRCode(document.getElementById('qr-container'), {
      text: '<%= qrUrl %>',
      width: 130,
      height: 130,
      colorDark: '#000000',
      colorLight: '#ffffff',
      correctLevel: QRCode.CorrectLevel.H
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>